  },
  "armedMicrophoneDeniedWindows": "Windows does not let Woodshed Player use the microphone, so «Armed» is off again. Switch on “Microphone access” and “Let desktop apps access your microphone” in Settings › Privacy & security › Microphone, then switch it on again.",
